	(text "Each coil is drawn as a net tie: the coil copper and both of its leads carry the\n_P/_A net; the tie at the end of the N lead joins the _N/_B net.\nLAYOUT: net ties at the coil lead exits; coil terminals are hand-routed\n(tools/stator_layout.py) because both lead ends belong to the same net."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 140 0)
		(effects
			(font
